ename":"17ca97277e462c33fa954f59.gif","width":22,"height":22,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"17ca972795a63083fe306c86.gif","width":22,"height":22,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"17ca9727a2361e93fde0dd02.png","width":20,"height":20,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"17ca9727b0b62eb3fe38c534.png","width":20,"height":20,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"17ca97267c962d13fe25eb5a.gif","width":22,"height":22,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"17ca9726be5622e3fde56fc2.gif","width":22,"height":22,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"17ca9727d2062c43fe381c17.png","width":64,"height":64,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"17ca9727d2062c43fe381c17.png","width":64,"height":64,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"17ca9727d2062c43fe381c17.png","width":64,"height":64,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"17ca97267c962d13fe25eb5a.gif","width":22,"height":22,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"17ca972809a62303fe317c0d.png","width":22,"height":22,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"17ca97267c962d13fe25eb5a.gif","width":22,"height":22,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"17ca972829862d73fe3e2556.gif","width":22,"height":22,"ocr_result":null},{"filename":"17ca97267c962d13fe25eb5a.gif","width":22,"height":22,"ocr_result":null}],"extend_st_home_page":{"ip_location":"","st_mention_stock_count":1,"ai_card":null,"ai_status":false,"speech_enable":false,"speech_info":null},"censor_state":0,"forbidden_retweet":false,"vod_info":null,"text":"<p><img class=\"ke_img\" src=\"https://xqimg.imedao.com/17ca97262d762d93fe475582.png\" /></p> <p>曾经我在微博中抛出了一个网上讨论过的问题：给你1000万，你会卖掉你的老公吗？底下的神回复真是绝了，让人忍俊不禁的同时也不得不感叹：有些女同胞们对自己的老公怨气很重嘛~~不过，也有不少舍不得卖的。</p> <p><img class=\"ke_img\" src=\"https://xqimg.imedao.com/17ca972661462e73fe648492.jpeg\" /></p> <p>大伙也可以<b>选择一下</b>并在本文的最下面<b>写下你的理由。</b></p> <p><b>看她们如何说：</b></p> <p><b>一、双手赞成的</b></p> <p><b>瘦瘦的粽：</b>卖1万都怕买家找后账，说我诈骗…</p> <p><b>月映千川1：</b>不给钱都想卖掉。</p> <p><b>漫天飞舞06：</b>白送都没人要哦</p> <p><b>大脸猫陈陈：</b>毫无疑问！毫不犹豫！</p> <p><b>木木：</b>谢天谢地！终于可以出手了！价钱相当不错呀！</p> <p><b>吉方方：</b>卖！再把他融资租赁租回来。用这一千万的大部分买房，剩下的用来自己深造。</p> <p